{"seq":1,"slug":"typescript","title":"TypeScript","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":8,"docCount":28,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript","rating":{"composite":4.43,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":4.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"typescript-简介\">TypeScript 简介</h1><p>TypeScript 是由微软开发并维护的开源编程语言，它在 JavaScript 的基础上增加了静态类型系统，为现代 Web 开发提供了更强大的工具支持和更可靠的代码质量保障。自发布以来，TypeScript 已经成为前端和全栈开发领域中最受欢迎的语言之一，被 Angular、Vue、React 等主流框架广泛采用。</p>\n<p>选择 TypeScript 的理由是显而易见的。JavaScript 作为一门动态类型语言，在大型项目中容易出现难以追踪的类型错误。TypeScript 通过在编译阶段捕获这些错误，显著降低了运行时 Bug 的发生概率。同时，类型信息为编辑器提供了精准的智能提示和自动补全能力，极大地提升了开发效率和代码可维护性。</p>\n<p>本手册面向具备 JavaScript 基础、希望系统掌握 TypeScript 的开发者。无论你是刚接触类型系统的前端工程师，还是希望深入理解高级类型编程的资深开发者，都能在这里找到适合自己的内容。</p>\n<p>全书共分为八个章节，按照由浅入深的逻辑组织。第一章&quot;基础类型&quot;从类型注解与推断出发，带你认识 TypeScript 的基本类型体系。第二章&quot;函数与泛型&quot;深入函数类型和泛型编程，这是编写可复用代码的关键。第三章&quot;接口与类&quot;讲解面向对象编程在 TypeScript 中的实现方式。</p>\n<p>第四章&quot;高级类型系统&quot;是本手册的核心重点，涵盖联合类型、交叉类型、类型守卫、映射类型、条件类型以及模板字面量类型等进阶主题，帮助你掌握 TypeScript 类型系统的全部威力。第五章&quot;模块与声明&quot;介绍模块化开发与声明文件的编写，解决与第三方库的协作问题。</p>\n<p>第六章&quot;工具类型与模式&quot;系统梳理内置工具类型并引导你构建自定义工具类型，掌握类型层面的设计模式。第七章&quot;配置与工具&quot;聚焦 tsconfig 配置、编译选项和项目构建，帮助你搭建高效的开发环境。第八章&quot;实践与最佳实践&quot;汇总类型安全的设计模式、错误处理策略、JavaScript 迁移方案以及常见反模式，将理论转化为工程实践。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序依次学习，每一章都建立在前一章的知识基础之上。在学习过程中动手实践、反复推敲类型的运作方式，是真正掌握 TypeScript 的最佳途径。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basic-types","title":"基础类型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-annotations-and-inference","title":"类型注解与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/type-annotations-and-inference"},{"seq":2,"slug":"primitives-and-literal-types","title":"原始类型与字面量类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/primitives-and-literal-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"arrays-tuples-and-enums","title":"数组、元组与枚举","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/arrays-tuples-and-enums"},{"seq":4,"slug":"any-unknown-never-void","title":"any、unknown、never 与 void","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/any-unknown-never-void"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"functions-and-generics","title":"函数与泛型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/functions-and-generics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"function-types-and-overloads","title":"函数类型与重载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/functions-and-generics/function-types-and-overloads"},{"seq":2,"slug":"generics-basics","title":"泛型基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/functions-and-generics/generics-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"generic-constraints-and-inference","title":"泛型约束与推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/functions-and-generics/generic-constraints-and-inference"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"interfaces-and-classes","title":"接口与类","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/interfaces-and-classes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interface-definition-and-implementation","title":"接口定义与实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/interfaces-and-classes/interface-definition-and-implementation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classes-and-inheritance","title":"类与继承","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/interfaces-and-classes/classes-and-inheritance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"abstract-classes-and-modifiers","title":"抽象类与访问修饰符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/interfaces-and-classes/abstract-classes-and-modifiers"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-type-system","title":"高级类型系统","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/advanced-type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"union-and-intersection-types","title":"联合类型与交叉类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/advanced-type-system/union-and-intersection-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"type-guards-and-narrowing","title":"类型守卫与类型收窄","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/advanced-type-system/type-guards-and-narrowing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mapped-and-conditional-types","title":"映射类型与条件类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/advanced-type-system/mapped-and-conditional-types"},{"seq":4,"slug":"template-literal-types","title":"模板字面量类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/advanced-type-system/template-literal-types"},{"seq":5,"slug":"type-level-programming","title":"类型体操入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/advanced-type-system/type-level-programming"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"modules-and-declarations","title":"模块与声明","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/modules-and-declarations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-system","title":"模块系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/modules-and-declarations/module-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"declaration-files","title":"声明文件与类型声明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/modules-and-declarations/declaration-files"},{"seq":3,"slug":"namespaces-and-directives","title":"命名空间与三斜杠指令","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/modules-and-declarations/namespaces-and-directives"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"utility-types-and-patterns","title":"工具类型与模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/utility-types-and-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"built-in-utility-types","title":"内置工具类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/utility-types-and-patterns/built-in-utility-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"custom-utility-types","title":"自定义工具类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/utility-types-and-patterns/custom-utility-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"type-level-patterns","title":"类型级编程模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/utility-types-and-patterns/type-level-patterns"}]},{"seq":7,"slug":"configuration-and-tooling","title":"配置与工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/configuration-and-tooling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tsconfig-deep-dive","title":"tsconfig.json 详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/configuration-and-tooling/tsconfig-deep-dive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compiler-options-and-strict-mode","title":"编译选项与严格模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/configuration-and-tooling/compiler-options-and-strict-mode"},{"seq":3,"slug":"project-references-and-build","title":"项目引用与构建流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/configuration-and-tooling/project-references-and-build"}]},{"seq":8,"slug":"practice-and-best-practices","title":"实践与最佳实践","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/practice-and-best-practices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-safe-design-patterns","title":"类型安全的设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/practice-and-best-practices/type-safe-design-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"error-handling-and-type-safety","title":"错误处理与类型安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/practice-and-best-practices/error-handling-and-type-safety"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migrating-from-javascript","title":"从 JavaScript 迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/practice-and-best-practices/migrating-from-javascript"},{"seq":4,"slug":"common-antipatterns-and-pitfalls","title":"常见反模式与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/practice-and-best-practices/common-antipatterns-and-pitfalls"}]}]}